        <item>
            <title>1.0.17</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 17:01:29 +0900</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>173</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.17</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>
  body { font: -apple-system-body, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; }
  h3 { font-size: 13px; margin: 14px 0 6px; }
  h3:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  ul { margin: 6px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin-bottom: 5px; }
  p { margin: 6px 0; }
</style>
<h3>New</h3>
<ul>
<li>Blast is available straight away after Auto-Blast. If the fans are still easing down, pressing Blast takes them to full speed at once.</li>
<li>Your curve stays selected while Blast is on. The picker keeps showing Curve, and the curve takes over again when Blast ends.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Improved</h3>
<ul>
<li>The title bar has a frosted glass blur behind the app name when content scrolls under it.</li>
<li>The divider lines beside the sidebar and under the title bar are gone.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>The What&#x27;s New panel had no notes to show for 1.0.16. Notes are now bundled with each release.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
